which is really nice.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.675
MELANIE WARRICK: It's amazing.

00:00:18.675 --> 00:00:19.550
MARK MANDEL: Awesome.

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:22.820
So today we're going to have
a really great conversation

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:24.650
