cool things of the week?

00:00:42.467 --> 00:00:44.341
MELANIE WARRICK: I think
that's a great idea.

00:00:44.341 --> 00:00:46.460
And I know one of the
main things we definitely

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:48.820
were excited about was
the fact that there

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:51.710
