00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:17.665
And they're like, yay,
let me throw money at you.

00:14:17.665 --> 00:14:18.540
FRANCESC CAMPOY: How?

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:19.660
Uh, random ID.

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:20.600
COLT MCANLIS: Don't
worry about that.

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:20.740
[LAUGHTER]

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:21.676
MARK MANDEL: Yeah,
that's not important.

00:14:21.676 --> 00:14:22.426
COLT MCANLIS: Yes.

00:14:22.426 --> 00:14:24.310
MARK MANDEL: Say we have
a customer in there,

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:25.900
we've hit a performance problem.

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:27.820
Obviously go to watch
Performance Atlas is

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:28.400
